        <mxCell id="JyVURD4Gw2GWekH6HKCA-75" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontStyle=1" value="&lt;span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;TICKET BOOKING SYSTEM&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="290" x="280" y="10" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="JyVURD4Gw2GWekH6HKCA-76" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-shadow: none !important; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;A platform that allows users to discover and purchase tickets for various entertainment options like movies, concerts, and live events.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="720" x="65" y="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="JyVURD4Gw2GWekH6HKCA-80" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;br style=&quot;padding: 0px; margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Non-Functional Requirements:&lt;br style=&quot;padding: 0px; margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Target Scale&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;: The system must be designed to support 100 Million Daily Active Users &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;(DAU).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;padding: 0px; margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;High Availability&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;: When users are searching or viewing an event, the system must prioritize &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;being &quot;always online&quot; (High Availability). It is better to show slightly older &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;data than to show an error page.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;padding: 0px; margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;High Consistency&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;: When a user is booking a specific ticket, the system must be Highly &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Consistent. Two people should never be able to book the exact same seat &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;at the exact same time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;624&quot; data-end=&quot;636&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-start=&quot;624&quot; data-end=&quot;635&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Latency&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Search &amp;lt; 200ms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; |&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;B&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;ooking &amp;lt; 1–2 sec&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="530" x="500" y="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="JyVURD4Gw2GWekH6HKCA-81" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Functional Requirements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Search Functionality&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;: The user must be able to discover events using filters such as the Event Title, &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;the City/Location, and the specific Date of the show.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Event Information Display: The user must be able to view comprehensive details for a specific event, &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;including the No of Seats (available vs. occupied), a detailed Description, &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;and Metadata (cast, duration, language, ratings).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Booking Execution&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;: The system must allow a user to select a seat and complete a transaction to &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Book a Ticket.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="570" x="-210" y="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="JyVURD4Gw2GWekH6HKCA-82" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;1lc36j5&quot; data-start=&quot;782&quot; data-end=&quot;797&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt; API Design&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;nv0y6b&quot; data-start=&quot;799&quot; data-end=&quot;814&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Search APIs&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;GET /events?title=&amp;amp;city=&amp;amp;date=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;815&quot; data-end=&quot;857&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;u3t1k8&quot; data-start=&quot;859&quot; data-end=&quot;876&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Event Details&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;GET /events/{event_id}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;877&quot; data-end=&quot;911&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;izz990&quot; data-start=&quot;913&quot; data-end=&quot;934&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Seat Availability&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;GET /events/{event_id}/seats&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;935&quot; data-end=&quot;975&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1xiso5r&quot; data-start=&quot;977&quot; data-end=&quot;1019&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Lock Seats (Important for consistency)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;POST /seats/lock&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Body: { event_id, seat_ids, user_id }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;1020&quot; data-end=&quot;1086&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;93wl2j&quot; data-start=&quot;1088&quot; data-end=&quot;1103&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Book Ticket&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;POST /bookings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Body: { user_id, event_id, seat_ids, payment_id }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;1104&quot; data-end=&quot;1180&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1v9n5yl&quot; data-start=&quot;1182&quot; data-end=&quot;1199&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;User Bookings&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-